    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1852-a1">

                <pb facs="1478" n="1362" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg1362"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister for Foreign Relations to the Minister of
                        Venezuela</hi>.</head>
                <p>We have just taken leave of Secretary Knox. You will say to President Taft that
                    Mr. Knox leaves with us pleasurable impressions and that it is our wish that our
                    relations with that great nation may grow more and more cordial.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Matos.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
